**Skills:** `Skills:`, `Interests:`, `Community:` labels plus condensed items from `Career/Hobbies-Activities.md`. Do not copy first-person hobby prose.

**Examples/** is third-party layout reference only — never copy their content.

Cover letters: reusable packets use date + `Dear Hiring Team:`; named employers use inside address + `Re:`. Cover letters may name both jobs and projects. Name LaunchPage Studio as the project and Automotive Operations System / TaxTracker Pro as work inside it.
